        "text": "Questions\nHere are a few questions and thought experiments that you may ponder, some based on the skills you\nlearned in this chapter, and others revealed in later parts of the book:\n1.\nIf we have a relatively large number of Linux VM instances or distros deployed and running\nat the same time, how could we make it easier to manage them?\nHint : Use Vagrant , a tool for building and managing VM environments.\n2.\nCan we run multiple Linux instances in WSL?\nHint : We can.",
